  },
  {
   "x": 7.92,
   "y": 1.56,
   "w": 4.91,
   "h": 0.27875,
   "text": "Same equation, extra inertia",
   "font": "Arial",
   "font_size": 13.5,
   "color": "#8EDBD4",
   "word_wrap": false,
   "align": "left",
   "valign": "top",
   "margin": 0.02,
   "bold": true,
   "type": "text",
   "id": "o037",
   "name": "C3-E05 text 37"
  },
  {
   "x": 7.95,
   "y": 2.0,
   "w": 4.9,
   "h": 0.25333333333333335,
   "text": "R_iR̈ᵢ + (3/2)Ṙᵢ² + Σ (Rⱼ²R̈ⱼ + 2RⱼṘⱼ²)/dᵢⱼ = Bᵢ",
   "font": "Arial",
   "font_size": 12,
   "color": "#E7F0F3",
   "word_wrap": false,
   "align": "left",
   "valign": "top",
   "margin": 0.02,
   "bold": true,
   "type": "text",
   "id": "o038",
   "name": "C3-E05 text 38"
  },
  {
   "x": 7.95,
   "y": 2.85,
   "w": 4.9,
   "h": 0.4397222222222222,
   "text": "Bᵢ = [p_b,i − p∞ − 2σ_b/Rᵢ − 4μṘᵢ/Rᵢ] / ρ  (isolated\ndriving)",
   "font": "Arial",
   "font_size": 11.5,
   "color": "#B4C7D2",
   "word_wrap": false,
   "align": "left",
   "valign": "top",
   "margin": 0.02,
   "type": "text",
   "id": "o039",
   "name": "C3-E05 text 39"
  },
  {
   "x": 8.17,
   "y": 3.6,
   "w": 4.680000000000001,
   "h": 0.45666666666666667,
   "text": "Identical neighbours move together, so the extra\nterm acts as added liquid mass.",
   "font": "Arial",
   "font_size": 12,
   "color": "#E7F0F3",
   "word_wrap": false,
   "align": "left",
   "valign": "top",
   "margin": 0.02,
   "type": "text",
   "id": "o040",
   "name": "C3-E05 text 40"
  },
  {
   "x": 7.984999999999999,
   "y": 3.6583333333333337,
   "w": 0.09,
   "h": 0.09,
   "fill": "#8EDBD4",
   "line": "#8EDBD4",
   "line_width": 1,
   "type": "ellipse",
   "id": "o041",
   "name": "C3-E05 ellipse 41"
  },
  {
   "x": 8.17,
   "y": 4.1066666666666665,
   "w": 4.680000000000001,
   "h": 0.25333333333333335,
   "text": "The closer the neighbour, the slower the expansion.",
   "font": "Arial",
   "font_size": 12,
   "color": "#E7F0F3",
   "word_wrap": false,
   "align": "left",
   "valign": "top",
   "margin": 0.02,
   "type": "text",
   "id": "o042",
   "name": "C3-E05 text 42"
  },
  {
   "x": 7.984999999999999,
   "y": 4.165,
   "w": 0.09,
   "h": 0.09,
   "fill": "#8EDBD4",
   "line": "#8EDBD4",
   "line_width": 1,
   "type": "ellipse",
   "id": "o043",
   "name": "C3-E05 ellipse 43"
  },
  {
   "x": 8.17,
   "y": 4.409999999999999,
   "w": 4.680000000000001,
   "h": 0.25333333333333335,
   "text": "Energy is shared, not created.",
